That's making me wonder if this is a repeat of the past pattern: a silent server-side change that spikes usage/token consumption across all models, which Anthropic only acknowledges after enough media/community pushback like they did before.

Has anyone else noticed usage climbing sharply on the newer versions? I haven't seen so much talk about it. Wondering if it's only me having the issue or everyone.

